<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="1200" height="690" viewBox="0 0 1200 690" role="img" aria-labelledby="title desc"><title id="title">普通残差与 Hyper-Connections：竖向结构，左右并排</title><desc id="desc">左侧为普通 Transformer block 和局部展开，右侧为 Hyper-Connections block 和局部展开。每张结构图内均保持从下向上的数据流。</desc><defs><linearGradient id="orange" x1="0" x2="0" y1="0" y2="1"><stop stop-color="#e88b33"/><stop offset="1" stop-color="#efe9df"/></linearGradient><marker id="arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6.2" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L7 3.5L0 7Z" fill="#343434"/></marker></defs><style>text{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC',sans-serif;fill:#262626}.wire{fill:none;stroke:#343434;stroke-width:1.7;marker-end:url(#arrow)}.dash{fill:none;stroke:#626262;stroke-width:1.5;stroke-dasharray:4 4}</style>
<text x="250" y="28" text-anchor="middle" font-size="22" font-weight="650">普通 Transformer block</text>
<text x="850" y="28" text-anchor="middle" font-size="22" font-weight="650">带 Hyper-Connections 的 Transformer block</text>
